[size=3][b]1.2.2[/b][/size]
[list]
[*][b]The spike trap actually looks like adamant now[/b], with the same purple crystalline surface as the block instead of a slightly darkened iron trap. Same shape as before.
[*][b]Corrected:[/b] this page used to say you could pick the trap back up. You cannot. Mining one returns an Adamant Ingot, half of what it cost.
[/list]
