[size=5][b][color=#b78ae8]AI Disclosure[/color][/b][/size]
[list]
[*][b]Item icons[/b] (ore, ingot): generated with OpenAI image generation (gpt-image-1), then cropped, scaled and cleaned up by hand.
[*][b]Block texture[/b] (diffuse and normal maps): generated procedurally by a script written with AI assistance, not hand-painted.
[*][b]Code, XML configuration and the 13 translations[/b]: written with the help of Anthropic's Claude, reviewed before release.
[/list]

